WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.140
(Episode 95) Before returning to the country,

2
00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.620
I've already reported to the police

3
00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.140
and handed over

4
00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:04.140
all the evidence from two years ago

5
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.380
to them.

6
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.580
It's been a while,

7
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.900
so the police should be here soon.

8
00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.540
Dad, you can't escape.

9
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:12.500
How dare you report me to the police and arrest me?

10
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.740
I'm your father!

11
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:14.980
Right in front of me,

12
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.300
you still want to hit my daughter?

13
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:17.740
Do you

14
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.020
want to go to jail

15
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:19.940
right now, huh?

16
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:20.680
Mom,

17
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.200
please sit down.

18
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.940
Dad,

19
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.420
there's something you might not know.

20
00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.380
Since three months ago,

21
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.340
I've started

22
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.700
buying shares of the Curtis Group.

23
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.500
Now, my mom is the largest shareholder

24
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:36.540
of the Curtis Group.

25
00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.620
It was my mom's

26
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.020
strong support

27
00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.780
and investment

28
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:42.780
that allowed you to succeed in your business.

29
00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.460
It's time for you

30
00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:45.260
to leave the Curtis Group.

31
00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:46.340
How is that possible?

32
00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.660
Where did you get the money?

33
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.700
This card has no spending limit.

34
00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:53.500
You can swipe it however you want.

35
00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:56.100
You really don't need me

36
00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.020
to acquire the Curtis Group

37
00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.140
and transfer it to your name.

38
00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.840
No need.

39
00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:03.240
I will personally

40
00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:04.620
take back the Curtis Group.

41
00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:05.980
I will slowly pay back

42
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.020
the money I owe you.

43
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.100
I don't need you to repay me.

44
00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:15.140
We should draw a clear line between public and
private life.

45
00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.540
Although we are together now,

46
00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:18.940
I hope that

47
00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.460
we can rely on each other emotionally

48
00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:23.620
and be financially independent.

49
00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:26.700
You don't need to worry about it.

50
00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:28.580
You

51
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:31.220
heartless daughter!

52
00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:31.740
When I

53
00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:33.460
pushed your mother down the stairs,

54
00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:35.260
I should have strangled you to death.

55
00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:36.340
Today, I'm going to

56
00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.380
kill you both,

57
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:38.460
you evil women.

58
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:39.760
Stop!

59
00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:42.620
Let go of me!

60
00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:43.460
Are you okay?

61
00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.180
Oliver Curtis,

62
00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:46.420
someone reported you

63
00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.500
for attempted murder.

64
00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:48.740
Now come with us

65
00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:49.500
and cooperate with the investigation.

66
00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:49.700
Move.

67
00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:51.380
You called the police to arrest me.

68
00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.260
You heartless daughter, you will die miserably!
